<title>NETHERLANDS: ING Barings ups Aegon to HOLD.</title>
<headline>ING Barings ups Aegon to HOLD.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Nov 18 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Aegon	     Insurancexxx  94.00   ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Nine month 1996 net profit in line with expectations. Because of its high life insurance content Aegon deserves a higher valuation than bancassurance groups and banks. Life insurance premiums are growing. Also, Aegon underperformed the financial sector in 1996.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	   P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)			18.5    2.37</p>
<p>    1996		   5.80	  16.0    2.75</p>
<p>    1997		   6.45	  14.5    3.03</p>
<p>    1998		   7.13	  13.1    3.35</p>
